  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We have option to see icons only, but no nameplates only. Icons are great but there is no reason to force people to always see them. \nJust because people pay for it, or just because I paid for it, does not mean everyone must be forced to see it.\nThis is social game where we create content and select what we want to see, why force this one element on us for no reason.\nAt very least at least add this option to people that have vrc+... so they can hide other users icons. \nBut it should be something in base game, many people just don't want to clutter their UI with some useless elements.",
